invariant: INV-14
file: src/srv_resume.c
catches: srv_flight_test
reason: the server opens an offered ticket under ticket_key alone, so a key
  change ends every live ticket, which ticket_key_previous exists to
  prevent (srv_cfg.h, docs/decisions.md 220). test/srv_resume_tests.h's
  test_resume_previous_key requires the old key's ticket to resume.

--- old
    return srv_ticket_open(widemul, cfg->srv.ticket_key_previous, identity, identity_len, c);
--- new
    return rc;
